## Phase 8: What Gets Stored & Displayed

### The Snapshot (Database)

Everything is saved as a **BOM Snapshot** via [BomRepo.save_snapshot()](file:///d:/Work_Stuff/Projects/S-BOM/backend/app/repositories/store.py):

```
bom_snapshots table
├── id, organization_id, project_id, scan_id
├── scanner_name, scanner_version
├── generated_at
├── raw_metadata (JSON blob containing vulnerability_matches[])
│
bom_components table (one row per package)
├── name, version, ecosystem, purl, license, supplier
├── direct_dependency (true/false)
├── risk ("Safe" | "Low" | "Medium" | "High" | "Critical")
├── cve_count (integer)
└── raw (JSON blob with compliance_status, vulnerabilities[], hashes, depth)
```

### The Frontend Display

The API serves this data through several endpoints consumed by the UI:

| Endpoint | Returns | Used By |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `GET /api/v1/scans/{id}/components` | All packages found | Software Inventory page |
| `GET /api/v1/scans/{id}/vulnerabilities` | All CVE matches | Vulnerability Triage page |
| `GET /api/v1/projects` | Project risk summaries | Projects & Dashboard |

